sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant A as Node A
    participant B as Node B

    Note over A,B: Duplex synchronisation A → B

    par A's outgoing direction
        A->>B: VERSIONS
        opt A initiated the connection
            A->>B: PRIORITY
        end
    and B's outgoing direction
        B->>A: VERSIONS
    end

    A->>B: OFFER*

    alt Message is already present and visible
        B->>A: ACK*
    else Message is unknown
        B->>A: REQUEST*
        A->>B: MESSAGE*
        B->>A: ACK*
    end

    Note over A,B: The same exchange can run in<br> the reverse direction
